OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrested after city centre
OL,4,Afirework disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fdisorder, involving fireworks being set
OL,8,Foff, in a city centre.
OL,10,FFootage posted on social media showed
OL,11,Fcrowds gathered on Corporation Street
OL,12,Fin Birmingham, with fireworks being set
OL,13,Foff close to police officers and
OL,14,Fvehicles.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Police had warned firm
OL,17,Faction would be taken against anyone
OL,18,Finvolved in fireworks-related disorder,
OL,19,Ffollowing serious incidents in the city
OL,20,Fduring Bonfire Night last year.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
