OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrested after city centre
OL,4,Afirework disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose arrested, aged between 15 and 26,
OL,7,Fwere held on suspicion of offences
OL,8,Fincluding assault, possession of
OL,9,Ffireworks and possession of an
OL,10,Foffensive weapon.
